                    "text": "in 1 Trigger"
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "code": "\r\n// A digital model of a vactrol filter, quasi 'analog' in behaviour.\r\n// The behaviour is similar to [slide~] in MSP/RNBO or [slide] in gen~\r\n// @see also: evi_vactrol_buchla.gendsp\r\n\r\ntanA2(x)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// approx tan(0..halfpi)\n{\n\ta\t= ((((x * -0.0896638) + 0.0388452) * x) + 1.00005) * x;\r\n\tb\t= (((x * -0.430871) + 0.0404318) * x) + 1;\r\n\treturn\ta / b;\r\n}\r\n\r\nlikeAvactrol(V, up, down)\r\n{\r\n\tHistory\ts0(0);\r\n\r\n\tF  = clip(((s0 > V) * up) + down, 0.01, HALFPI);\r\n\tw2 = tanA2(F * PI / SAMPLERATE);\r\n\tg0 = w2 / (w2 + 1);\r\n\r\n\tG  = (V - s0) * g0;\r\n\tY  =  G + s0;\r\n\r\n\ts0 =  G + Y;\r\n\treturn\tY;\r\n}\r\n\r\nParam\tscalein(3, min=1, max=10000);\t// static\r\nParam\tscaleout(1, min=1, max=1000);\t// ...\r\n//Param\trise(0.0707107, min=0, max=1);\t// % 0..1\r\n//Param\tfall(sqrt1_2, min=0, max=1);\t// ...\r\nParam\tmode(0, min=0, max=3);\r\nmd\t\t= int(mode);\t\t\t\t\t// 0 = rise/fall params, 1..3 = fixed\r\nrise\t= in2;\r\nfall\t= in3;\r\nup = (md > 0) ? ((md > 1) ? ((md > 2) ? 6000 : 1000) : 600) : rise*rise*rise*7800 + 200;\r\ndown = (md > 0) ? ((md > 1) ? ((md > 2) ? 0.08 : 0.04) : 0.02) : (fall*0.9999 + 0.0001) * 0.1;\r\n\r\nvoltage\t = in1 * scalein;\r\n\r\nout1\t = likeAvactrol(voltage, up, down) * scaleout;\r\n\r\n",
                    "fontface": 0,
                    "fontname": "<Monospaced>",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-3",
                    "maxclass": "codebox",
                    "numinlets": 3,
                    "numoutlets": 1,
                    "outlettype": [ "" ],
                    "patching_rect": [ 49.0, 58.0, 772.0, 675.0 ]
                }
            },
